## Programme

- 17:00 Welcome
- 17:15 Talk: a five-year handover plan
- 18:30 Open discussion
- 19:30 Drinks

## About the evening

Many family companies plan the handover too late, and they plan it alone. This evening brings together owners, board members and their advisers to talk about what works. The talk shows a real handover plan, with the milestones, the governance steps and the conversations that came first.

The open discussion is not led by a panel of experts. Owners who have been through a handover are invited to share their experience, and so are those who are still at the start.

Seats are limited. Please register early, and tell us if you need a seat with step-free access.
